-mermaid-_r_4us_ .node path{fill:rgb(210, 196, 158);stroke:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);stroke-width:1px;}#chatgpt-mermaid-_r_4us_ .node rect{rx:16px;ry:16px;}#chatgpt-mermaid-_r_4us_ .node.mermaid-decision .label-container{fill:rgb(221, 213, 193);stroke:rgb(167, 130, 18);stroke-dasharray:2,2;}#chatgpt-mermaid-_r_4us_ .edgePaths .flowchart-link{stroke:rgba(43, 92, 109, 0.682);stroke-width:1px;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;}#chatgpt-mermaid-_r_4us_ .marker{fill:rgba(43, 92, 109, 0.682);stroke:rgba(43, 92, 109, 0.682);}#chatgpt-mermaid-_r_4us_ :root{--mermaid-font-family:-apple-system-body,ui-sans-serif,-apple-system,system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",Helvetica,\"Apple Color Emoji\",Arial,sans-serif,\"Segoe UI Emoji\",\"Segoe UI Symbol\";}OC Efficiency Rule EngineCommon Financial RulesFabric Process RulesOpen OC Estimation RulesClose Control RulesSales / COGSCostsheetMaterial CostProcessing CostOverheadGM / EfficiencyOC DệtOC NhuộmDệt → MộcMộc → VảiOC Dệt → nhiều OC NhuộmRetained MaterialConsumption VarianceEstimated Final CostEstimated GMProduced vs Order QtyNear CompletionOC not ClosedClose WarningRecalculate after Close\n\n---\n\n# 14. Garment Rule vs Fabric Rule Gap Matrix\n\n|Rule Area|Garment|Fabric|Decision|\n|---|---|---|---|\n|Sales Revenue|Có|Tương tự|`REUSE`|\n|Costsheet|Có|Tương tự|`REUSE`|\n|Cost/unit|Có|Theo kg|`ADAPT`|\n|Consumption|Có|Tương tự report|`REUSE`|\n|Inventory Transaction|Có|Cần để trace Dệt → Nhuộm|`ADAPT`|\n|Material variance|Có|Quan trọng hơn rất nhiều|`ADAPT`|\n|Processing Cost|Có|Gia công Dệt|`REUSE/ADAPT`|\n|Factory OVH|Có|Có|`REUSE`|\n|Common OVH|Có|Có|`REUSE`|\n|GM / Efficiency|Có|Công thức tương tự|`REUSE`|\n|Normal/Abnormal|Có|Threshold khác|`ADAPT`|\n|Open OC Estimated Cost|Không trọng yếu|Critical|**`NEW`**|\n|Retained Material|Không trọng yếu|Critical|**`NEW`**|\n|OC Close Warning|Không trọng yếu|Critical|**`NEW`**|\n|Dệt → Nhuộm lineage|Không|Có|**`NEW`**|\n|1 upstream OC → N downstream OC|Không trọng yếu|Có|**`NEW`**|\n|Event recalculation on Close|Chưa phải core|Critical|**`NEW`**|\n\nWorkshop cuối cùng cũng xác nhận phần lớn công thức/report có thể dùng lại từ Garment, thay đổi chủ yếu nằm ở process và threshold. Pasted text Pasted text\n\n---\n\n# 15. Data Flow hiện tại\n\n#chatgpt-mermaid-_r_4uj_{font-family:-apple-system-body,ui-sans-serif,-apple-system,system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",Helvetica,\"Apple Color Emoji\",Arial,sans-serif,\"Segoe UI Emoji\",\"Segoe UI Symbol\";font-size:17px;fill:rgb(43, 92, 109);}@keyframes edge-animation-frame{from{stroke-dashoffset:0;}}@keyframes dash{to{stroke-dashoffset:0;}}#chatgpt-mermaid-_r_4uj_ .edge-animation-slow{stroke-dasharray:9,5!important;stroke-dashoffset:900;animation:dash 50s linear infinite;stroke-linecap:round;}#chatgpt-mermaid-_r_4uj_ .edge-animation-fast{stroke-dasharray:9,5!important;stroke-dashoffset:900;animation:dash 20s linear infinite;stroke-linecap:round;}#chatgpt-mermaid-_r_4uj_ .error-icon{fill:rgba(230, 224, 209, 0.96);}#chatgpt-mermaid-_r_4uj_ .error-text{fill:rgb(43, 92, 109);stroke:rgb(43, 92, 109);}#chatgpt-mermaid-_r_4uj_ .edge-thickness-normal{stroke-width:1px;}#chatgpt-mermaid-_r_4uj_ .edge-thickness-thick{stroke-width:3.5px;}#chatgpt-mermaid-_r_4uj_ .edge-pattern-solid{stroke-dasharray:0;}#chatgpt-mermaid-_r_4uj_ .edge-thickness-invisible{stroke-width:0;fill:none;}#chatgpt-mermaid-_r_4uj_ .edge-pattern-dashed{stroke-dasharray:3;}#chatgpt-mermaid-_r_4uj_ .edge-pattern-dotted{stroke-dasharray:2;}#chatgpt-mermaid-_r_4uj_ .marker{fill:rgba(43, 92, 109, 0.682);stroke:rgba(43, 92, 109, 0.682);}#chatgpt-mermaid-_r_4uj_ .marker.cross{stroke:rgba(43, 92, 109, 0.682);}#chatgpt-mermaid-_r_4uj_ svg{font-family:-apple-system-body,ui-sans-serif,-apple-system,system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",Helvetica,\"Apple Color Emoji\",Arial,sans-serif,\"Segoe UI Emoji\",\"Segoe UI Symbol\";font-size:17px;}#chatgpt-mermaid-_r_4uj_ p{margin:0;}#chatgpt-mermaid-_r_4uj_ .label{font-family:-apple-system-body,ui-sans-serif,-apple-system,system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",Helvetica,\"App