		{
			"id":"2b5571d50188bffd",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"- DỰ BÁO SẢN LƯỢNG --- \n\t- AS-IS: VIA POWER BI AS COLLECTIVE SPACE FOR DATA - TIME SERIES ANAlYSIS -> MACHINE LEARNING + DEEP LEARNING  \n\t\t\t- *CHALL: NOT ENOUGH RESOURCES / CANNOT CAPTURE ENOUGH DIMENSION + FEATURES ENGINEERING - TO RUN TRAINING AND ANALYSIS *\n\t  - INPUT:\n\t  - OUTPUT:\n\t  - METHOD: \n\t\t  - DESCRIPTIVE\n\t\t  - FORECASTING",
